        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key (underlined) · &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; foreign key · &lt;b&gt;UK&lt;/b&gt; unique&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UK&lt;/b&gt; on &lt;i&gt;tags.code&lt;/i&gt; is unique together with &lt;i&gt;device_id&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;type | null&lt;/i&gt; = nullable column&lt;br&gt;Crow’s foot = many; bar = exactly one; circle = zero or one&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Integrity rules outside Prisma&lt;/b&gt; (CHECK constraints)&lt;br&gt;assets: parent_id ≠ id · shift_assignments: ends_at &amp;gt; starts_at&lt;br&gt;dashboard_widgets: width ∈ {3,4,6,8,12}, height 1–3&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Design notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;assets.path = /root/…/self/ (materialized path: subtree = LIKE '%/id/%')&lt;br&gt;alarms copy tag, asset and severity at raise time (history stays true)&lt;br&gt;dashboard_widgets.config = the query of the matching page (Zod-validated per type)&lt;br&gt;measurements (tag_id, ts) is the time-series key; TimescaleDB is the upgrade path" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
